          "title": "Questions 21-24: Notice",
          "text": "UNIVERSITY PRINT CENTER\nResearch posters must be submitted as PDF files sized 90 x 120 centimeters. Orders received by noon Monday through Thursday will be ready by 4:00 P.M. the same day. Orders received after noon will be ready the next business day. Friday orders may be collected on Monday. Standard printing is free for faculty and students. Same-day rush service is available for an additional $15.",
          "zh": "大学打印中心\n研究海报必须以 PDF 文件提交，尺寸为 90 x 120 厘米。周一至周四中午前收到的订单，当天下午 4:00 前可取。中午之后收到的订单，下个工作日可取。周五的订单可在周一领取。教职员工和学生的标准打印免费。当天加急服务需额外支付 15 美元。"
        },
        {
          "title": "Questions 21-24: Message",
          "text": "To: Hana Lee\nI plan to upload my research poster at about 1:30 P.M. on Monday. My presentation is Wednesday morning, so the normal service should be fast enough. I will be at an off-campus meeting until 5:00 P.M. on Tuesday. Could you collect the poster when it is ready and leave it in my office? I cannot use the rush option because the project budget has already been spent. - Marco",
          "zh": "收件人：Hana Lee\n我打算周一下午 1:30 左右上传我的研究海报。我的报告在周三上午，所以常规服务应该够快了。周二我要在校外开会，一直到下午 5:00。海报做好后你能帮我取一下，放到我办公室吗？我没法用加急选项，因为项目预算已经花完了。—— Marco"
        }
